			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_Cache_fundamental/15-Bandwithdth - 加寬 (圖 b).png",
			"x": 414,
			"y": 1860,
			"width": 399,
			"height": 211
		},
		{
			"id": "9b4f05aeeacb24a1",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_Cache_fundamental/17-Bandwithdth.png",
			"x": 414,
			"y": 2180,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 216
		},
		{
			"id": "9a03ee9f7bcf05de",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- **Read hit**：直接回資料。\n    \n- **Read miss**\n    \n    - **Read-allocate**（預設）：把整個區塊載入快取，再回資料。\n        \n    - **Read-through**：不載入，直接從下層讀給 CPU（少用）。\n        \n- **Write hit**\n    \n    - **Write-through**：同時寫快取與下層；簡單，需搭配 write buffer。\n        \n    - **Write-back**：只改快取並設 **dirty**，被替換時才寫回；效能佳，複雜。\n        \n- **Write miss**\n    \n    - **Write-allocate**：先把區塊拉進快取，再寫；常與 write-back 搭配。\n        \n    - **Write-around（no-allocate）**：不載入，直接寫下層；常與 write-through 搭配。",
			"x": 260,
			"y": -300,
			"width": 690,
			"height": 298,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "218cf260ddada29b",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_Cache_fundamental/02-Read hit 直接回資料。.png",
			"x": 1140,
			"y": -521,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 205
		},
		{
			"id": "c4891d63dff890d6",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_Cache_fundamental/07-Read miss - Read hit 直接回資料。.png",
			"x": 1140,
			"y": -200,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 210
		},
		{
			"id": "3f3c4025a042f868",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_Cache_fundamental/09-Read miss - 常見配對.png",
			"x": 1140,
			"y": 100,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 219
		},
		{
			"id": "b770f8884ca5b35d",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_Cache_fundamental/05-Write-through.png",
			"x": 1780,
			"y": -203,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 217
		},
		{
			"id": "38491d342fe30689",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_Cache_fundamental/10-Write-through.png",
			"x": 1780,
			"y": 100,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 234
		},
		{
			"id": "ef1404da3dcbbd1a",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_Cache_fundamental/03-Write hit.png",
			"x": 1760,
			"y": -520,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 207
		},
		{
			"id": "c6cf248ffb4adbcf",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- **常見配對**\n    \n    - **Write-through + Write-around（no-allocate）**：避免在寫入失誤時把整塊搬進快取，減少匯流排流量。\n        \n    - **Write-back + Write-allocate**：之後多次寫同一塊都在快取內完成，效能好。\n        \n- **可行但較少見**\n    \n    - **Write-through + Write-allocate**：命中率可能提高，但每次寫仍要下傳，流量大。\n        \n    - **Write-back + Write-around**：會把常寫資料留在下層，失去 write-back 優勢。",
			"x": 260,
			"y": 40,
			"width": 690,
			"height": 216,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "98bf93e64460d408",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_Cache_fundamental/08-常見配對.png",
			"x": -260,
			"y": -103,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 202
		}
	],
